    <comment>The sum of mole fractions in the initial gas mixtures given by the authors is not always exactly 1.000000, in some NH3/O2/He/Ar cases, there is a +/-0.0001 deviation. In these cases, correction was applied to make the sum of mole fractions equal to 1.000000. The difference between the sum and 1 was calculated and it was distributed between x_He and x_Ar according to their original ratio as corrections. This way, neither the equivalence ratio nor the x_Ar/x_He ratio change.</comment>
